{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n いただいた\n お花の紹介します🌼\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7PJ510GBRHHGYK1VD4JS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n くまさんの顔が隠れてしまいました泣\n くまさんのお人形可愛い〜\n FOR YOUって書いてあって可愛い💕\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7QH2ZTW8V7932109QEQ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n オレンジ大好きなんです🧡\n 春を感じます\n 夏になったら\n ひまわり畑に行きたいな〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7RRKWHPEN5YH658PFCPT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n このお花を見た時\n とっても嬉しい気分になりました💓\n ほっこりしたよ〜ありがとう😊\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7SRHD8MABE1T2SK847J7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n お花畑からお花を摘んできたみたい！\n はあ〜いい匂いがしたよ💕\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7TTX0GQNX9PJQF3FHZKQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n おっきい〜\n 卒業式のお祝いって感じがする💐\n ありがとう😊\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7VVMSRV346ND1XRQBGZ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n なんか美味しそう〜\n 花瓶が可愛いです💕💕\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7WVPN743X0NNFBFQV6JS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n おっきい〜\n ふわふわしてて可愛い❤️❤️\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7XTGTVXEVEE0QAWAXT43","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 風船いっぱい可愛い💕🎈\n いつもありがとう😊😊\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC7YVTGV7444NK0Q88478J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ひらがなけやき宛に！\n ありがとうございます😊😊\n 頑張ります！\n \n \n \n \n いつもありがとう😊😊\n とっても嬉しい気持ちになるよ〜"}],"source":"archive"}